  "description": "The Dove frame comes equipped with all the latest technology, such as investment cast in the seat stays bridge, dropouts, and chain stays yoke, as well as multi-butted and tapered tubing with internal gussets. Those features combined with Dovey's preferred geometry, make this frame a perfect fit for all kind of transitions.\n\nAfter several requests for a revival of Tierra frame, we've also reintroduced its geometry with a few subtle adjustments, for modern park riding.\n\nSo, whatever your transition riding style is smashing bowls, trails, or parks, the brand-new Dove frame has got you covered.\n\n• This product is covered with Lifetime Warranty.\n• EBS Brake kit NOT included.\n• Replacement stickers included.",
